AiTask category_collapse_alert {
  label: "Category Revenue Collapse Alert"
  description: "Posts the categories whose weekly revenue fell 80% or more to Slack."
  brief: @md
    1. From @Dataset:ecommerce_official, get revenue by product category for last week (the last complete Monday–Sunday week) and the week before.
    2. Find every category whose revenue dropped 80% or more.
    3. Write a short alert listing those categories with their revenue and change. Write the result with the write_ai_task_result skill.

    Delivery: If at least one category dropped 80% or more, post the alert to the Slack channel #nhity-test. Otherwise, send nothing.
  ;;
  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - Covers exactly the last complete Monday–Sunday week and the week before.
    - Lists every category that dropped 80% or more, and no others.
  ;;
}
